Error: Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch: Shift operators work on integer values only
  --> Tests/UI/float_lane_shift.jet:5:12
    |
  5 |     print((f << 1).to_array())
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: The left side is the value being shifted and the right side is its bit count
 Fix: Use whole-number operands
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch

Error: Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch: This operator works on integer values only
  --> Tests/UI/float_lane_shift.jet:6:12
    |
  6 |     print((f & f).to_array())
    |            ^^^^^
 Why: Remainder and bitwise operations preserve an integer width
 Fix: Use whole-number operands
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch
